          "schema:name": "igf_dataset_with_fitnessJuvenile IGF-1 concentrations, life history, and morphological data for female spotted hyenas from the long-term research project on spotted hyenas in the Masai Mara National Reserve in Kenya. Each row represents a unique female. Variables are described in detail in the associated manuscript.female_cub.csv",
